## The Corner Formula

The Corner Formula is the relationship between a princess cut stone's face-up width and the men's band it sits in — with a corner protection factor built in.

A princess cut is a square. Its corners are exactly 90 degrees. Those corners are the thinnest part of the stone. [GIA](https://www.gia.edu/) measures a 1ct princess at approximately 5.5mm × 5.5mm face-up. That is narrower than a 1ct round brilliant (6.5mm). The square shape means every millimeter matters. Those corners define the visual edge of the stone on the band.

The Corner Formula has two parts:

**Part 1 — Band Coverage:** Princess width ÷ band width × 100 = coverage percentage. A 1ct princess (5.5mm) on a 7mm band = 79% coverage. This is acceptable. Under 70% coverage, the stone looks undersized and the prong gap grows.

**Part 2 — Corner Clearance:** V-prong tip must extend past the stone corner by minimum 0.3mm on each side. A V-prong that seats flush with the corner provides no protection. The 0.3mm overhang absorbs glancing contact before it reaches the stone.

| Carat | Face-Up Width | 7mm Band Coverage | Min V-Prong Overhang | What this means |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 0.75 ct | ~5.1mm | 73% | 0.3mm per corner | Minimum viable size for 7mm band; prong gap visible |
| 1.00 ct | ~5.5mm | 79% | 0.3mm per corner | Ideal for 6–7mm band; square fills the face correctly |
| 1.25 ct | ~5.9mm | 84% | 0.3mm per corner | Strong presence; correct on 7mm band |
| 1.50 ct | ~6.0mm | 86% | 0.3mm per corner | Maximum for standard 7mm; oversized on 6mm band |
| [1.5ct lab GCAL D-IF — $2,980](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29417594?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | ~6.0mm | 86% | 0.3mm — specify V-prong | Best value at this size; D-IF certified |

**Verdict:** The Corner Formula targets 1ct princess (5.5mm) as the ideal center stone for 6–7mm men's band widths. It delivers 79–92% band coverage depending on exact band width. Pair a [1ct GIA G-VS2 Ideal princess at $2,212](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28961307?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) with the [Structured Solitaire at $1,732](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/mens-structured-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-item-147399?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) for a $3,944 complete ring.

